{"id":"vd-a2-snow-on-the-line","level":"a2","n":3,"title":{"en":"Terrible Weather, Isn't It?","vi":"Thời tiết tệ quá nhỉ?"},"summary":"Tàu đứng yên giữa trời tuyết; bà Ada bắt chuyện với Theo bằng những câu xã giao quen thuộc — và cuộc trò chuyện dần đi xa hơn chuyện thời tiết.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-a2-snow-on-the-line","level":"a2","title":{"en":"Snow on the Line","vi":"Tuyết phủ đường ray"}},"scene":{"background":"train","weather":"snow","props":[{"id":"mug","x":820,"y":560,"scale":0.8}]},"cast":{"ada":{"name":{"en":"Ada","vi":"Ada"},"look":"grandma","x":520,"style":{"scarf":"#C0392B","outfit":"coat","top":"#34495E","topShade":"#2C3E50"}},"theo":{"name":{"en":"Theo","vi":"Theo"},"look":"teenboy","x":1140,"style":{"hair":"curly","hairColor":"#6B4226","outfit":"jacket","top":"#5D6D7E","topShade":"#4D5B69"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"ada","en":"Terrible weather, isn't it?","vi":"Thời tiết tệ quá nhỉ?","ipa":["ˈtɛɹəbəl","ˈwɛðɚ","ˈɪzənt","ɪt"],"start":0.554,"end":2.064,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,0.933],[2,1.531],[3,1.797]]},{"speaker":"theo","en":"Yes, it is. I've never seen so much snow.","vi":"Vâng, đúng thế ạ. Cháu chưa bao giờ thấy nhiều tuyết đến vậy.","ipa":["jɛs","ɪt","ɪz","aɪv","ˈnɛvɚ","sin","soʊ","mʌtʃ","snoʊ"],"start":2.854,"end":6.964,"expression":"shy","timing":[[0,2.854],[1,3.528],[2,3.668],[3,5.021],[4,5.289],[5,5.608],[6,5.99],[7,6.245],[8,6.513]]},{"speaker":"ada","en":"Three hours, the driver said. Where are you going?","vi":"Ba tiếng, người lái tàu nói vậy. Cháu đi đâu thế?","ipa":["θɹi","ˈaʊɚz","ðə","ˈdɹaɪvɚ","sɛd","wɛɹ","ɑɹ","ju","ˈɡoʊɪŋ"],"start":7.754,"end":11.584,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,7.754],[1,7.993],[2,8.631],[3,8.751],[4,9.163],[5,10.549],[6,10.802],[7,10.935],[8,11.081]]},{"speaker":"theo","en":"Home, to my parents. It's my first visit since September.","vi":"Về nhà, về với bố mẹ ạ. Đây là lần đầu cháu về kể từ tháng Chín.","ipa":["hoʊm","tu","maɪ","ˈpɛɹənts","ɪts","maɪ","fɝst","ˈvɪzɪt","sɪns","sɛpˈtɛmbɚ"],"start":12.374,"end":16.764,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,12.374],[1,12.968],[2,13.096],[3,13.249],[4,14.819],[5,15.023],[6,15.189],[7,15.546],[8,15.903],[9,16.196]]},{"speaker":"ada","en":"How lovely. Are you a student?","vi":"Hay quá. Cháu là sinh viên à?","ipa":["haʊ","ˈlʌvli","ɑɹ","ju","ə","ˈstudənt"],"start":17.554,"end":20.244,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,17.554],[1,17.69],[2,19.262],[3,19.435],[4,19.581],[5,19.661]]},{"speaker":"theo","en":"Yes, I'm at college in the city.","vi":"Vâng, cháu học cao đẳng trên thành phố.","ipa":["jɛs","aɪm","æt","ˈkɑlɪdʒ","ɪn","ðə","ˈsɪti"],"start":21.034,"end":23.014,"gesture":"nod","timing":[[0,21.034],[1,21.659],[2,21.863],[3,21.991],[4,22.45],[5,22.527],[6,22.616]]},{"speaker":"ada","en":"And what do you study?","vi":"Thế cháu học ngành gì?","ipa":["ənd","wʌt","du","ju","ˈstʌdi"],"start":23.804,"end":24.784,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,23.804],[1,23.897],[2,24.07],[3,24.163],[4,24.282]]},{"speaker":"theo","en":"Music. That's my cello. How about you? Are you visiting family?","vi":"Âm nhạc ạ. Đó là cây đàn cello của cháu. Còn bà thì sao? Bà đi thăm gia đình ạ?","ipa":["ˈmjuzɪk","ðæts","maɪ","ˈtʃɛloʊ","haʊ","əˈbaʊt","ju","ɑɹ","ju","ˈvɪzɪtɪŋ","ˈfæməli"],"start":25.574,"end":31.854,"expression":"shy","timing":[[0,25.574],[1,27.059],[2,27.327],[3,27.493],[4,28.934],[5,29.177],[6,29.445],[7,30.618],[8,30.784],[9,30.899],[10,31.32]]},{"speaker":"ada","en":"Yes, my grandchildren. They're five and seven.","vi":"Ừ, thăm các cháu. Chúng năm và bảy tuổi.","ipa":["jɛs","maɪ","ˈɡɹænˌtʃɪldɹən","ðɛɹ","faɪv","ənd","ˈsɛvən"],"start":32.644,"end":36.424,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,32.644],[1,33.199],[2,33.358],[3,35.157],[4,35.37],[5,35.729],[6,35.901]]},{"speaker":"theo","en":"I like your scarf. It's a lovely color.","vi":"Cháu thích chiếc khăn của bà. Màu đẹp quá ạ.","ipa":["aɪ","laɪk","jɔɹ","skɑɹf","ɪts","ə","ˈlʌvli","ˈkʌlɚ"],"start":37.214,"end":40.264,"expression":"shy","timing":[[0,37.214],[1,37.281],[2,37.561],[3,37.702],[4,39.157],[5,39.348],[6,39.425],[7,39.858]]},{"speaker":"ada","en":"Thank you! My granddaughter made it.","vi":"Cảm ơn cháu! Cháu gái bà đan đấy.","ipa":["θæŋk","ju","maɪ","ˈɡɹænˌdɔtɚ","meɪd","ɪt"],"start":41.054,"end":43.804,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,41.054],[1,41.253],[2,42.546],[3,42.746],[4,43.317],[5,43.557]]},{"speaker":"ada","en":"So, do you play in concerts?","vi":"Thế cháu có biểu diễn ở các buổi hoà nhạc không?","ipa":["soʊ","du","ju","pleɪ","ɪn","ˈkɑnsɚts"],"start":44.344,"end":46.264,"expression":"thinking","prop":"mug","timing":[[0,44.344],[1,44.925],[2,45.032],[3,45.138],[4,45.391],[5,45.51]]},{"speaker":"theo","en":"Not really. I get very nervous in front of an audience.","vi":"Không hẳn ạ. Cháu rất run khi đứng trước khán giả.","ipa":["nɑt","ˈɹɪli","aɪ","ɡɛt","ˈvɛɹi","ˈnɝvəs","ɪn","fɹʌnt","ʌv","æn","ˈɑdiəns"],"start":47.054,"end":50.944,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,47.054],[1,47.319],[2,48.647],[3,48.838],[4,49.03],[5,49.323],[6,49.757],[7,49.897],[8,50.114],[9,50.19],[10,50.305]]},{"speaker":"ada","en":"Nervous? That's normal. Everybody is.","vi":"Run à? Chuyện bình thường thôi. Ai cũng thế mà.","ipa":["ˈnɝvəs","ðæts","ˈnɔɹməl","ˈɛvɹiˌbɑdi","ɪz"],"start":51.734,"end":56.184,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,51.734],[1,53.269],[2,53.628],[3,55.105],[4,55.73]]},{"speaker":"theo","en":"Maybe. By the way, I'm Theo.","vi":"Có lẽ vậy ạ. À, cháu tên là Theo.","ipa":["ˈmeɪbi","baɪ","ðə","weɪ","aɪm","ˈθioʊ"],"start":56.974,"end":60.014,"expression":"shy","timing":[[0,56.974],[1,58.37],[2,58.574],[3,58.715],[4,59.25],[5,59.467]]},{"speaker":"ada","en":"Nice to meet you, Theo. I'm Ada.","vi":"Rất vui được gặp cháu, Theo. Bà là Ada.","ipa":["naɪs","tu","mit","ju","ˈθioʊ","aɪm","ˈeɪdə"],"start":60.804,"end":63.944,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,60.804],[1,61.05],[2,61.169],[3,61.422],[4,61.901],[5,63.34],[6,63.566]]},{"speaker":"theo","en":"Nice to meet you, too.","vi":"Cháu cũng rất vui được gặp bà.","ipa":["naɪs","tu","mit","ju","tu"],"start":64.734,"end":66.184,"expression":"happy","react":{"ada":"happy"},"timing":[[0,64.734],[1,64.987],[2,65.101],[3,65.331],[4,65.765]]}],"words":[{"id":"weather","en":"weather","ipa":"ˈwɛðɚ","vi":"thời tiết","level":0},{"id":"visit","en":"visit","ipa":"ˈvɪzɪt","vi":"thăm; ghé thăm; chuyến thăm","level":0},{"id":"college","en":"college","ipa":"ˈkɑlɪdʒ","vi":"trường cao đẳng; trường đại học","level":0},{"id":"nervous","en":"nervous","ipa":"ˈnɝvəs","vi":"lo lắng, hồi hộp; thuộc thần kinh","level":1},{"id":"audience","en":"audience","ipa":"ˈɑdiəns","vi":"khán giả; người xem","level":1},{"id":"normal","en":"normal","ipa":"ˈnɔɹməl","vi":"bình thường; thông thường","level":1}],"focus":{"title":"Chuyện xã giao với người lạ","pattern":"Terrible weather, isn't it? · Where are you going? · Are you visiting …? · What do you do? · How about you? · Nice to meet you.","explain":"Mở lời bằng thời tiết + câu hỏi đuôi: \"Terrible weather, isn't it?\" (xuống giọng, chờ đồng tình). Hỏi nhẹ nhàng về chuyến đi và công việc: \"Where are you going?\", \"What do you do?\". Hỏi lại cho công bằng: \"How about you?\". Kết bằng \"Nice to meet you.\"","keys":["isn't it","where are you going","are you visiting","what do you do","how about you","nice to meet you"],"lines":[0,2,7,15,16]},"audio":{"src":"/audio/library/videos/vd-a2-snow-on-the-line.mp3","v":"0d2c31c353","duration":67.272,"fps":25,"mouth":""}}